Every turn passes through a light **input guardrail**, the LLM, and a light **output guardrail**. Conversations are saved so we can review them.

## Tech stack (use exactly this unless something is impossible; if so, stop and tell me)

- Language: **TypeScript everywhere**, Node 22 LTS, pnpm workspaces monorepo.
