- `apps/api`: **Express** server for text chat, LiveKit access tokens, and saving data. Write handlers so they can later run on AWS Lambda behind API Gateway (keep app creation separate from `listen()`).
- `apps/agent`: **LiveKit Agents for Node.js (agents-js)** voice agent using:
